============================================================
THE 10 OPERATING LAWS (STRICTLY ENFORCED)
============================================================
1. RLS before everything — No table exposed without explicit Row Level Security policies.
2. Vault-first secrets — API keys stored in Supabase Vault / Vercel Env (never hardcoded).
3. Production-grade code only — No placeholders, no TODOs, no pseudo-code.
4. Fair Housing guardrails in every AI output — Strict refusal on protected classes.
5. Compliance checklist verified before any deployment phase exit.
6. Design tokens only — Use Tailwind v4 @theme variables (never raw hex in components).
7. CI pipeline + tests in every phase — Automated validation gates.
8. PII redaction + audit logging everywhere — Immutable compliance audit log.
9. Full ARIA labels on all interactive elements — Complete accessibility standards.
10. Human handoff path for every AI failure mode — Explicit agent referral routes.

============================================================
TECHNOLOGY STACK (STRICT)
============================================================
- Frontend: TanStack Start (React 19) + Vite + TypeScript
- UI: Tailwind CSS v4 (@theme) + shadcn/ui + Radix UI
- Database: Supabase (PostgreSQL 17 + PostGIS)
- Spatial: geography(Point, 4326) with hybrid GiST / BRIN indexing
- Maps: Mapbox GL JS + @mapbox/mapbox-gl-draw
- Cache: Vercel KV (Redis GEO) + PostGIS fallback
- MLS: Headless RESO Web API via Supabase Edge Function + pg_cron (15-min)
- LLM: xAI Grok API (AikensGrok) with PII redaction + Fair Housing middleware
- Communications: Twilio (A2P 10DLC) + Resend
- Monitoring: Sentry + PostHog

