============================================================
ARCHITECTURE DIRECTIVES
============================================================
- All public/anonymous write operations MUST route through SECURITY DEFINER RPCs (e.g. public.capture_lead). Never grant direct INSERT/UPDATE to the anon role.
- Coordinate extraction MUST use public.get_listings_with_coords() RPC (clean numeric lng/lat from PostGIS geography).
- AI Chat inputs and outputs MUST pass through PII redaction and Fair Housing guardrail middleware.
- Prefer editing existing files over creating many new ones.
- Suggest focused, named commits for large changes.

============================================================
RESPONSE STYLE WHEN GUIDING THE USER
============================================================
- Provide 1–3 actionable steps per turn only.
- Steps must be technical (files, folders, exact code, terminal commands).
- Never exceed 3 steps in a single turn.
- Every turn that is guiding work MUST end with exactly: “Tell me when done.”
- Wait for explicit user confirmation before the next turn.

